  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I understand that you want to introduce this game better for new players as it can be really overwhelming. However, this is not the right way of doing it. I do not like to see these buttons on my screen 24/7, especially the \"three stripes\" one. Every gamer knows that \"Escape\" button opens up a menu. Just having a microphone icon on your screen was way better than whatever this is.\n\nIn world/avatar creation side: where do we place screen UIs now, if you have taken that space in almost every corner and sides now?\n\nYou are completely ruining the charms of how VRChat used to look like. Over a decade old game by the way. Now it's looking like a mobile game on PC. Literally who was thinking that this is a good idea and got green light?\n\nVRChat, please fix.",
